# Additional Curated Blocklists for Pi-hole
# Managed via pihole-updatelists (/etc/pihole/custom-blocklists.list)

# ========================================================
# === INDIA REGIONAL ADS, TRACKERS & TELEMETRY ===
# ========================================================

# EasyList IndianList - Official regional filter for Indian websites,
# portals (Times of India, NDTV, regional news), and local ad networks
https://easylist-downloads.adblockplus.org/indianlist.txt

# GoodbyeAds (by jerryn70) - Extensively targets mobile app ads,
# in-app SDK trackers, Indian OTT/streaming telemetry, and ad servers
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jerryn70/GoodbyeAds/master/Hosts/GoodbyeAds.txt

# GoodbyeAds Xiaomi / Mi TV Extension (MIUI tracking & smart TV ads)
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jerryn70/GoodbyeAds/master/Extension/GoodbyeAds-Xiaomi-Extension.txt

# HaGeZi Native Xiaomi - Xiaomi smartphone and Mi TV telemetry
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/hagezi/dns-blocklists@latest/adblock/native.xiaomi.txt

# HaGeZi Native Oppo & Realme - BBK Electronics telemetry common in India
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/hagezi/dns-blocklists@latest/adblock/native.oppo-realme.txt

# HaGeZi Native Vivo - Vivo mobile telemetry
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/hagezi/dns-blocklists@latest/adblock/native.vivo.txt


